                    %a{:href => "#interpretationintermsofhighertopostheory"} interpretation in terms of higher topos theory
            %li
              %p Partial surveys
              %p
                These links point to pages that contain notes on aspects of the theory that are in the style of and originate from
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a{:href => "http://nd.edu/~rgrady/elliptic_seminar.html"} a seminar on A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology
              %ol
                %li
                  %p
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+cohomology+theories"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - cohomology theories
                %li
